WEBVTT

00:00:07.960 --> 00:00:09.790
Kyo's so late.

00:00:09.790 --> 00:00:11.990
What's taking him so long?

00:00:11.990 --> 00:00:17.160
He said he had something important to 
talk to Master about before practice.

00:00:24.570 --> 00:00:27.990
You want to open up the 
church as an event venue?

00:00:27.990 --> 00:00:28.670
Yes.

00:00:28.670 --> 00:00:32.260
It would be able to earn 
some income that way,

00:00:32.260 --> 00:00:37.160
and it might make for a place for the 
girls to continue holding concerts.

00:00:37.930 --> 00:00:39.700
Oh, dear.

00:00:40.130 --> 00:00:43.850
I never thought you'd have more trouble 
giving up than the kids would.

00:00:44.930 --> 00:00:46.260
Sorry.

00:00:46.850 --> 00:00:50.610
Though maybe I'm the most 
stubborn out of all of us.

00:00:53.730 --> 00:00:54.680
All right.

00:00:54.680 --> 00:00:55.960
Give it a shot.

00:00:55.960 --> 00:00:57.290
Really?

00:00:57.290 --> 00:00:58.990
You have a month, for now.

00:01:00.120 --> 00:01:05.600
If you can make something happen in a 
month, I'll consider going along with it.

00:01:05.600 --> 00:01:06.210
Got it?

00:01:08.470 --> 00:01:09.270
Yes.

00:02:50.470 --> 00:02:52.460
So you're back here again.

00:02:56.980 --> 00:02:59.350
You look glum. What's wrong?

00:02:58.740 --> 00:03:00.450
<b>Strawberry
Au Lait</b>

00:03:01.250 --> 00:03:02.530
I can have this?

00:03:02.530 --> 00:03:03.770
Nope.

00:03:03.770 --> 00:03:04.680
It's mine.

00:03:04.680 --> 00:03:06.790
Talk about getting my hopes up.

00:03:08.010 --> 00:03:09.590
I'll give you bread, though.

00:03:09.590 --> 00:03:10.750
I have enough to sell.

00:03:10.750 --> 00:03:12.620
You literally do.

00:03:15.630 --> 00:03:18.040
Today's pick is...

00:03:19.150 --> 00:03:20.260
Here you...

00:03:23.130 --> 00:03:24.980
Don't get any weird thoughts!

00:03:24.980 --> 00:03:27.180
I'm not thinking anything weird.

00:03:32.900 --> 00:03:35.360
So, what's on your mind?

00:03:35.780 --> 00:03:39.640
We sold hardly any tickets 
for the third concert.

00:03:40.070 --> 00:03:43.400
I know, it was only our 
acquaintances that showed up.

00:03:45.180 --> 00:03:50.290
I told you that you should charge 
high school students, including me.

00:03:50.620 --> 00:03:53.600
Everyone was intent on paying, anyway.

00:03:53.600 --> 00:03:55.930
I appreciate that sentiment,

00:03:55.930 --> 00:03:59.910
but I felt like we had a debt 
to pay to our first audience.

00:03:59.910 --> 00:04:00.920
A debt?

00:04:01.660 --> 00:04:08.060
It would never have been such a beautiful 
concert if people hadn't come that day.

00:04:09.180 --> 00:04:13.480
So I want those people to feel 
free to come when they want to.

00:04:15.890 --> 00:04:20.310
But there's no way we're going to be able 
to use it as an event venue, at this rate.

00:04:20.850 --> 00:04:24.670
I feel terrible letting Masayoshi-san down.

00:04:28.310 --> 00:04:30.910
You saw Master at the party, didn't you?

00:04:30.910 --> 00:04:32.700
After the first concert.

00:04:37.820 --> 00:04:38.670
That's rock!

00:04:38.670 --> 00:04:40.610
That's real rock!

00:04:40.610 --> 00:04:44.360
That's what I've always wanted to see.

00:04:46.110 --> 00:04:47.900
If you hadn't mentioned it first,

00:04:47.900 --> 00:04:53.470
he might have said he'd turn 
Little Wing into a live house for the kids.

00:04:53.470 --> 00:04:55.540
Then all the more.

00:04:55.540 --> 00:04:57.780
Masayoshi-san has hopes, too.

00:04:57.780 --> 00:04:58.710
I...

00:05:01.830 --> 00:05:03.420
Let's get going.

00:05:03.420 --> 00:05:04.950
Lunch break is almost over.

00:05:06.340 --> 00:05:08.070
Oh, yeah.

00:05:08.340 --> 00:05:10.450
To Kyo-san

00:05:08.730 --> 00:05:09.320
Here.

00:05:09.870 --> 00:05:10.450
What's this?

00:05:11.570 --> 00:05:15.410
The girls asked me to give it to you.

00:05:18.170 --> 00:05:20.540
Camping Invitation

00:05:18.170 --> 00:05:20.540
<b>Please be
there!
- Nozomi</b>

00:05:18.170 --> 00:05:20.540
<b>We're going camping this Saturday.
We'd be happy if you could come with us.
- Jun</b>

00:05:18.170 --> 00:05:20.540
<b>It'll be
fun! ♥
- Sora</b>

00:05:19.000 --> 00:05:20.540
An invitation to go camping?

00:05:20.540 --> 00:05:21.610
Yeah.

00:05:21.610 --> 00:05:24.290
We go camping around this time every year.

00:05:24.290 --> 00:05:26.680
The girls asked if you'd 
like to come with us.

00:05:27.160 --> 00:05:30.550
N-Not that I care, really.

00:05:31.500 --> 00:05:33.140
So, well?

00:05:33.960 --> 00:05:36.350
Yeah, I'm glad you invited me.

00:05:36.350 --> 00:05:38.260
I think I'll go.

00:05:39.460 --> 00:05:41.110
Yes!

00:05:46.210 --> 00:05:48.250
It's been a while since I've 
done anything like this.

00:05:52.010 --> 00:06:01.090
Kiriyume

00:05:52.010 --> 00:06:01.090
Are you there?

00:05:55.850 --> 00:06:01.090
I'm here

00:05:57.850 --> 00:06:01.090
I have a new one

00:06:05.640 --> 00:06:07.630
Uh... Are you angry?

00:06:07.630 --> 00:06:10.140
Are you angry?

00:06:09.150 --> 00:06:10.140
You aren't...

00:06:10.540 --> 00:06:12.430
At home much lately.

00:06:12.430 --> 00:06:13.290
Yeah.

00:06:13.290 --> 00:06:15.280
I've started going to school.

00:06:15.280 --> 00:06:16.620
That's no fun.

00:06:17.250 --> 00:06:20.060
We could talk more if you'd stay a shut-in.

00:06:20.060 --> 00:06:21.390
Come on.

00:06:21.390 --> 00:06:23.070
I'm finally doing better.

00:06:23.070 --> 00:06:25.500
That doesn't matter.

00:06:25.500 --> 00:06:29.450
You should be helping me kill 
time 24/7, 365 days a year.

00:06:31.170 --> 00:06:34.080
Well, sorry I'm away all the time.

00:06:34.810 --> 00:06:37.200
I have a feeling you aren't home 
much on weekends, either.

00:06:38.790 --> 00:06:39.330
Yeah.

00:06:39.740 --> 00:06:40.830
Actually...

00:06:45.130 --> 00:06:46.840
So that's what you were up to, huh?

00:06:47.650 --> 00:06:49.840
What are you, stupid?

00:06:50.800 --> 00:06:52.920
You are, aren't you?

00:06:52.920 --> 00:06:55.890
Why don't you upload promotional 
videos for your band

00:06:55.890 --> 00:06:57.310
if you want to sell more tickets?

00:06:57.730 --> 00:07:01.090
That's obviously the best way to advertise.

00:07:02.230 --> 00:07:04.570
That's true, but...

00:07:04.570 --> 00:07:06.980
Is there a reason you don't want to?

00:07:07.330 --> 00:07:13.990
Well, the band is a group 
of three fifth-grade girls.

00:07:23.860 --> 00:07:24.670
Uh...

00:07:25.100 --> 00:07:25.880
Kiriyume?

00:07:26.930 --> 00:07:28.880
Sorry, I was just reporting you.

00:07:29.290 --> 00:07:29.880
What...

00:07:29.880 --> 00:07:30.930
I'm kidding.

00:07:30.930 --> 00:07:32.940
We don't know each other in real life.

00:07:32.940 --> 00:07:34.700
I have no way of reporting you.

00:07:37.620 --> 00:07:39.350
O-Of course.

00:07:42.120 --> 00:07:44.030
So have you talked about it?

00:07:44.030 --> 00:07:45.230
Talked about what?

00:07:45.570 --> 00:07:47.050
To the kids in the band.

00:07:47.050 --> 00:07:50.780
That you could market them 
with a promotional video.

00:07:51.480 --> 00:07:52.660
I haven't.

00:07:53.700 --> 00:07:57.780
I feel like I might be forcing 
my own wishes on them,

00:07:58.150 --> 00:07:59.330
so I hesitated.

00:08:00.780 --> 00:08:04.600
You know, that's insulting to those girls.

00:08:04.600 --> 00:08:08.860
Fifth graders are old enough to 
think and act for themselves.

00:08:10.460 --> 00:08:13.380
You aren't the one who's going to 
decide whether or not to do it.

00:08:13.380 --> 00:08:14.550
It's the girls.

00:08:18.580 --> 00:08:21.690
<i>I'm not the one to decide.</i>

00:08:19.810 --> 00:08:22.310
You know, that's insulting to those girls. Fifth graders
are old enough to think and act for themselves.
You aren't the one who's going to decide whether or not to do it.
It's the girls.

00:08:22.980 --> 00:08:25.060
<i>It's the girls who need to decide.</i>

00:08:27.800 --> 00:08:31.190
<i>I'll ask them if they want to 
do a promotional video tomorrow.</i>

00:08:32.070 --> 00:08:32.440
Hey, Hibiki...

00:08:32.460 --> 00:08:33.700
Are you into grade-schoolers?

00:08:35.490 --> 00:08:38.080
Are you into grade-schoolers?

00:08:46.910 --> 00:08:48.130
Kyo.

00:08:48.130 --> 00:08:49.980
Kyo-nii.

00:08:49.980 --> 00:08:51.950
Good morning, Kyo-san.

00:08:51.950 --> 00:08:53.410
Morning, guys.

00:08:53.410 --> 00:08:55.180
Hey, you're here.

00:08:55.560 --> 00:08:58.820
The kids were making a huge fuss all morning,

00:08:58.820 --> 00:09:00.560
saying they wanted to 
look good for the video.

00:09:06.820 --> 00:09:08.520
You all look really cute.

00:09:09.740 --> 00:09:11.710
Th-Thank you.

00:09:11.710 --> 00:09:14.820
I-I'm always cute.

00:09:15.510 --> 00:09:18.410
Saku-nee's doing her best to look cute, too.

00:09:24.580 --> 00:09:27.250
She's been putting on makeup all morning.

00:09:27.250 --> 00:09:29.050
Oh, really?

00:09:29.050 --> 00:09:30.610
Sorry, I didn't notice.

00:09:32.540 --> 00:09:34.550
That was just skincare!

00:09:34.550 --> 00:09:37.470
We're going camping, and the 
UV rays are going to be harsh.

00:09:37.470 --> 00:09:40.300
I'm just doing what any girl would do.

00:09:42.810 --> 00:09:47.170
I mean, don't say things like that!

00:09:56.070 --> 00:09:56.990
There.

00:09:58.590 --> 00:10:00.450
We're all set.

00:10:05.450 --> 00:10:09.060
All right, let the battle commence.

00:10:09.910 --> 00:10:12.760
You're old. You don't need to look cool.

00:10:12.760 --> 00:10:15.450
I'll catch the big ones.

00:10:16.650 --> 00:10:20.140
Come on, you stooped to the ranks of a 
lure fisher, trying to keep up with me.

00:10:20.470 --> 00:10:22.470
I read the patterns of the day,

00:10:22.470 --> 00:10:26.960
set the lure to match the bait, 
and take my target in one fell swoop.

00:10:26.960 --> 00:10:28.870
This versatility and strategic prowess

00:10:28.870 --> 00:10:31.230
is something that a bait 
fisher would never attain.

00:10:31.230 --> 00:10:33.570
You talk as if you know something.

00:10:33.570 --> 00:10:36.490
You're really just afraid of touching bugs.

00:10:36.490 --> 00:10:38.100
I-I'm not!

00:10:38.100 --> 00:10:39.740
I have no problem touching worms.

00:10:39.740 --> 00:10:41.370
U-Uh...

00:10:41.370 --> 00:10:43.200
Masayoshi-san, Sakura...

00:10:44.500 --> 00:10:45.840
Sorry, Kyo.

00:10:45.840 --> 00:10:48.310
We're going to go fishing.

00:10:48.310 --> 00:10:52.420
Feel free to record your video, or have 
fun or whatever until we're back.

00:10:52.970 --> 00:10:54.670
Stay out of danger.

00:10:54.670 --> 00:10:58.210
We can go all the way upstream 
today, thanks to Kyo.

00:10:58.210 --> 00:11:01.580
We'll catch plenty of 
trout and cherry salmon.

00:11:02.410 --> 00:11:03.570
Uh...

00:11:04.050 --> 00:11:08.180
Are they always like that 
when they go camping?

00:11:09.650 --> 00:11:14.440
Master and Saku-nee fight every time, 
whether they catch anything or not.

00:11:14.440 --> 00:11:18.110
We can't play until they're done fishing.

00:11:18.110 --> 00:11:20.150
Don't you go fishing with them?

00:11:20.150 --> 00:11:21.610
No way.

00:11:21.610 --> 00:11:23.070
It gets way too tense.

00:11:23.070 --> 00:11:26.160
I'd rather just play word games.

00:11:26.160 --> 00:11:29.670
W-We were really looking 
forward to today, though.

00:11:29.670 --> 00:11:33.430
Because you're with us.

00:11:33.430 --> 00:11:35.410
Let's play, Kyo-nii.

00:11:35.410 --> 00:11:36.550
Don't do that, Sora.

00:11:36.980 --> 00:11:39.900
We're going to be filming for 
the promotional video today.

00:11:39.900 --> 00:11:41.550
That's what we decided, remember?

00:11:41.930 --> 00:11:45.300
I don't care, I just want 
to do something fun.

00:11:46.570 --> 00:11:49.430
Yeah, let's do something fun.

00:11:49.430 --> 00:11:51.180
Athletic Course

00:11:59.190 --> 00:12:00.870
That's our first one.

00:12:00.870 --> 00:12:03.190
The first one to the top is the winner.

00:12:03.190 --> 00:12:05.010
Ready, go!

00:12:05.010 --> 00:12:07.290
No fair, Zomi!

00:12:07.290 --> 00:12:09.990
Zomi-tan got a head start!

00:12:14.450 --> 00:12:15.560
Come on.

00:12:15.560 --> 00:12:16.960
Hurry up, Jun, Sora.

00:12:18.440 --> 00:12:21.660
I'm too scared to go any higher.

00:12:22.790 --> 00:12:25.010
Look, Kyo-nii.

00:12:25.690 --> 00:12:28.310
It's a daikon tree.

00:12:29.140 --> 00:12:32.270
Not that your legs are like daikon.

00:12:35.500 --> 00:12:37.730
<i>I-I think I'll cut that out.</i>

00:12:40.620 --> 00:12:41.990
It's so pretty.

00:12:41.990 --> 00:12:43.690
I know, right?

00:12:43.690 --> 00:12:45.860
This is my favorite spot.

00:12:47.170 --> 00:12:49.330
Nozomi, can you do that again?

00:12:50.700 --> 00:12:51.840
S-Sure.

00:12:55.850 --> 00:12:57.690
S-Something like that?

00:13:05.680 --> 00:13:06.840
It smells so nice.

00:13:06.840 --> 00:13:08.680
Kyo-nii.

00:13:11.310 --> 00:13:13.430
Docked with a butterfly.

00:13:15.240 --> 00:13:18.100
Sora, can you stay still for a bit?

00:13:18.940 --> 00:13:20.120
Got it.

00:13:24.750 --> 00:13:25.850
Nozomi.

00:13:25.850 --> 00:13:27.450
What's wrong? Are you okay?

00:13:27.450 --> 00:13:28.520
A bee!

00:13:28.520 --> 00:13:30.910
A bee got in my clothes!

00:13:32.670 --> 00:13:34.650
Please, get it out!

00:13:34.890 --> 00:13:35.580
Wait—

00:13:35.580 --> 00:13:36.910
Hurry!

00:13:36.910 --> 00:13:38.970
Hurry, get it out!

00:13:38.970 --> 00:13:40.450
All right.

00:13:40.450 --> 00:13:42.670
Okay, Nozomi.

00:13:42.670 --> 00:13:43.870
Hurry!

00:13:43.870 --> 00:13:45.010
Hurry!

00:13:50.910 --> 00:13:52.030
Is it gone?

00:13:52.030 --> 00:13:52.860
Yeah.

00:13:52.860 --> 00:13:54.520
You're safe now, Nozomi.

00:13:54.520 --> 00:13:56.870
Th-Thank goodness.

00:13:56.870 --> 00:13:58.520
Thanks.

00:14:03.570 --> 00:14:05.070
S-Sorry.

00:14:05.070 --> 00:14:06.460
I'm really sorry.

00:14:08.950 --> 00:14:10.710
Stare...

00:14:25.210 --> 00:14:26.800
What's wrong, Jun?

00:14:25.210 --> 00:14:31.470
<b>Nature Trail</b>

00:14:26.800 --> 00:14:28.610
Do you feel sick?

00:14:29.180 --> 00:14:33.040
That's not it, but...

00:14:33.040 --> 00:14:33.860
But?

00:14:36.450 --> 00:14:37.650
I got it.

00:14:37.650 --> 00:14:41.020
Kyo-nii, Jun-tan's holding in her pee.

00:14:42.620 --> 00:14:44.980
Can you not hold it in anymore?

00:14:46.480 --> 00:14:47.500
Uh...

00:14:47.500 --> 00:14:49.910
The closest washroom...

00:14:50.840 --> 00:14:54.100
We might want to go back to the tents.

00:14:54.100 --> 00:14:56.370
Why don't you go in the shrubs over there?

00:14:59.890 --> 00:15:00.910
Get on.

00:15:00.910 --> 00:15:02.670
Hold on just a little longer.

00:15:04.040 --> 00:15:05.230
Hurry!

00:15:11.750 --> 00:15:15.470
Kyo-san, I'm really, really sorry.

00:15:19.980 --> 00:15:21.850
Over here.

00:15:21.900 --> 00:15:23.480
Washrooms

00:15:24.180 --> 00:15:25.140
Just a little longer.

00:15:25.140 --> 00:15:26.120
Hang in there!

00:15:58.170 --> 00:15:59.900
I'm sorry, Kyo.

00:15:59.900 --> 00:16:03.140
I wanted to bring home some bigger ones,

00:16:03.140 --> 00:16:06.080
but Master was on tilt, 
and he dragged me down.

00:16:06.080 --> 00:16:08.010
Who's on tilt?

00:16:08.010 --> 00:16:10.530
I caught more than you did.

00:16:10.530 --> 00:16:14.500
I was the one who got the biggest one.

00:16:22.410 --> 00:16:23.260
Listen up.

00:16:23.260 --> 00:16:25.920
This is sudden death, all-or-nothing.

00:16:29.290 --> 00:16:31.800
Rock, paper, scissors.

00:16:34.970 --> 00:16:36.610
Victory.

00:16:37.880 --> 00:16:40.220
Following a rigorous challenge,

00:16:40.220 --> 00:16:44.730
it has been determined that I will be 
sleeping in Kyo-nii's sleeping bag.

00:16:46.690 --> 00:16:47.680
Don't want to?

00:16:47.680 --> 00:16:49.860
No, it's not that I don't want to.

00:16:49.860 --> 00:16:52.940
Not that I don't want to, but...

00:16:52.940 --> 00:16:53.570
Hey!

00:16:53.570 --> 00:16:54.520
What are you talking about?

00:16:54.520 --> 00:16:57.120
You're all sleeping in 
your own sleeping bags!

00:16:57.880 --> 00:16:58.740
Jealous?

00:17:00.890 --> 00:17:03.900
Saku-nee's actually the jealous type.

00:17:03.900 --> 00:17:04.870
Um...

00:17:04.870 --> 00:17:07.460
Do you want to sleep with 
Kyo-san, too, Saku-chan?

00:17:07.460 --> 00:17:08.510
No!

00:17:08.510 --> 00:17:09.540
Where did that come from?

00:17:09.540 --> 00:17:11.220
You don't want to?

00:17:11.220 --> 00:17:12.300
Are you sure?

00:17:12.300 --> 00:17:13.990
I don't...

00:17:15.310 --> 00:17:17.890
Dammit, Nozomi, stop being weird!

00:17:17.890 --> 00:17:19.420
Jun, Sora, you, too!

00:17:19.420 --> 00:17:22.020
Don't be so mean to Sakura.

00:17:22.330 --> 00:17:27.890
Besides, we'd end up with a baby if Kyo 
and Sakura slept in the same sleeping bag.

00:17:27.890 --> 00:17:31.020
O-O-Of course not, Master, you idiot!

00:17:31.020 --> 00:17:32.620
Why would you say something like that?!

00:17:32.620 --> 00:17:33.130
Really?

00:17:33.130 --> 00:17:34.510
That'll make babies?

00:17:35.550 --> 00:17:38.860
Would he or she be our brother or sister?

00:17:39.410 --> 00:17:43.240
Saku-chan, Saku-chan, 
you should sleep with Kyo-san!

00:17:43.240 --> 00:17:45.290
I will not! I will not! I will not!

00:17:45.740 --> 00:17:47.930
Everyone gets their own sleeping bag!

00:17:47.930 --> 00:17:49.000
That's final!

00:17:49.400 --> 00:17:51.950
No exceptions allowed!

00:17:58.600 --> 00:18:00.460
Hey, are you still awake?

00:18:01.620 --> 00:18:03.160
What is it, Zomi?

00:18:03.160 --> 00:18:05.770
What do you know about what 
they were saying earlier?

00:18:06.230 --> 00:18:07.770
What they were saying?

00:18:08.270 --> 00:18:12.900
Do you think if Kyo and Sakura slept 
together, that would make a baby?

00:18:13.800 --> 00:18:18.030
It's strange, but if Master 
says so, maybe it's true.

00:18:18.450 --> 00:18:20.420
Don't you want to experiment?

00:18:20.920 --> 00:18:21.910
Experiment?

00:18:21.910 --> 00:18:25.910
Let's try quietly putting 
Sakura in Kyo's sleeping bag.

00:18:26.950 --> 00:18:29.420
We'll get in trouble.

00:18:29.420 --> 00:18:31.370
It'll be fine.

00:18:31.370 --> 00:18:34.510
I think Sakura wanted to 
sleep with Kyo anyway.

00:18:34.510 --> 00:18:35.920
But...

00:18:35.920 --> 00:18:36.920
Mblah.

00:18:38.020 --> 00:18:41.680
The experiment is on.

00:18:54.940 --> 00:18:57.450
<i>Wh-Why?</i>

00:19:03.170 --> 00:19:05.080
<i>Wh-Why?</i>

00:19:44.810 --> 00:19:47.180
What am I doing?

00:19:48.570 --> 00:19:50.580
I'm so stupid!

00:20:00.900 --> 00:20:02.490
Morning, Sakura.

00:20:04.040 --> 00:20:05.140
Did you make a baby?

00:20:06.600 --> 00:20:08.140
Of course not!

00:20:08.140 --> 00:20:11.210
Wait, so it was <i>your</i> doing, wasn't it?

00:20:11.900 --> 00:20:15.190
I thought it would make you happy, Saku-chan.

00:20:15.190 --> 00:20:17.240
How would it make me happy?!

00:20:16.370 --> 00:20:18.510
Kyo-nii...

00:20:17.240 --> 00:20:18.510
First of all...

00:20:27.740 --> 00:20:32.680
Thank you for playing with us, Kyo-san.

00:20:32.680 --> 00:20:33.380
Well?

00:20:33.380 --> 00:20:34.710
Was camping fun?

00:20:35.210 --> 00:20:36.040
Of course.

00:20:37.950 --> 00:20:40.800
Kyo-nii, let's all go together again.

00:20:40.800 --> 00:20:41.800
Promise?

00:20:42.340 --> 00:20:43.050
Yeah.

00:20:47.470 --> 00:20:48.650
I'm home.

00:20:53.930 --> 00:20:56.280
You went to play with the girls.

00:20:56.280 --> 00:20:57.400
Y-Yes.

00:20:57.400 --> 00:20:59.420
Oh?

00:20:59.420 --> 00:21:03.950
You won't go out to play with me, 
but you sleep over with those girls.

00:21:03.950 --> 00:21:05.660
Sorry, Kurumi.

00:21:05.660 --> 00:21:07.280
Hey!

00:21:07.280 --> 00:21:09.010
Stop, get back here!

00:21:09.010 --> 00:21:09.910
I'm really sorry.

00:21:09.910 --> 00:21:11.660
I have something to do right now.

00:21:11.660 --> 00:21:13.580
I'll make it up to you, I promise.

00:21:15.290 --> 00:21:16.960
Jeez.

00:21:23.460 --> 00:21:24.760
There.

00:21:24.760 --> 00:21:26.720
<b>Make this video public</b>

00:21:24.760 --> 00:21:26.720
<b>Make public</b>

00:21:26.720 --> 00:21:30.170
Yes, please.

00:23:15.490 --> 00:23:20.000
<b>10,356 views</b>

00:23:19.210 --> 00:23:21.630
You're kidding me.

00:23:21.060 --> 00:23:25.000
<b>It's so fun taking pictures of you,
because you don't realize how cute you are.</b>

00:23:25.900 --> 00:23:31.360
I-I don't look too good 
in frilly, cute outfits.

00:23:25.900 --> 00:23:41.500
<b>#06: Don't Take the Bassist!</b>

00:23:31.360 --> 00:23:36.950
So, like, I really don't like 
the uniform at work, okay?

00:23:36.950 --> 00:23:38.980
Tsundere.
